            <div class="g-mt-30">
              <p>Tropialis, officially registered as <b>PT. TROPIALIS KARYA NUSANTARA</b>, is a premier online travel agency based in the heart of Bali. Established on February 12, 2025, and recognized under <b>SK KEMENKUMHAM</b> No. <b>AHU-0011064.AH.01.01.TAHUN 2025</b>, we specialize in curating exceptional travel experiences tailored to your unique preferences.</p>
              <p>Whether you’re looking for exhilarating tours, immersive cultural activities, or rejuvenating wellness retreats, Tropialis ensures that every journey is a seamless and unforgettable adventure. Our comprehensive travel services cover everything from guided explorations of Bali’s iconic landmarks to exclusive experiences such as cooking classes, water sports, and trekking adventures. Each itinerary is carefully crafted by our team of local experts to guarantee authenticity and excellence.</p>
              <p>At the core of Tropialis is a deep commitment to wellness. We offer a range of spa and massage services designed to revitalize your body and mind. Our handpicked wellness retreats feature traditional Balinese massages, holistic therapies, and yoga sessions, while our mobile massage service allows you to enjoy luxurious spa treatments in the comfort of your villa or hotel.</p>
              <p>Choosing Tropialis means opting for personalized service, local expertise, and a genuine passion for travel. We understand that every traveler is unique, which is why we create bespoke itineraries that align with your interests and desires. With Tropialis as your trusted travel partner, you can explore Bali with confidence, knowing that every detail has been thoughtfully arranged to provide an extraordinary experience.</p>
              <p>&nbsp;</p>
              <h5>Stay & Travel with Ease</h5>
              <p>Find the perfect villa, hotel, or resort that suits your budget and style, whether for a relaxing beach escape or an adventurous retreat. Need transportation? Book airport transfers, car rentals, or private drivers effortlessly.</p>
              <h5>Explore, Discover & Experience</h5>
              <p>From thrilling ATV rides, water sports, and jungle treks to serene yoga retreats and Balinese healing sessions, Tropialis brings handpicked activities to elevate your journey. Whether you're seeking adventure, culture, or relaxation, we’ve got something for everyone.</p>
              <h5>Seamless Ticketing & Classes</h5>
              <p>Skip the lines and book tickets instantly for Bali’s top attractions, including temples, water parks, and cultural performances. Want to learn something new? Join interactive cooking classes, surf lessons, and traditional art workshops for an immersive local experience.</p>
              <h5>Effortless Booking & Secure Payments</h5>
              <p>With an easy-to-use website and app, travelers can browse, compare, and book experiences within minutes. Secure payment options ensure peace of mind, while customer support guarantees a smooth journey.</p>
              <h5>Discover the magic of Bali with Tropialis – Your Gateway to Authentic Travel.</h5>
              <p>&nbsp;</p>
